    description "Mandelbulb3D formula _BT1_4D_clampXYZ. This isn't very different from the 3d version of Transform 1.  This particular 4d version keeps the original magnitude of xyz=sqrt(x^2+y^2+z^2) and scales xyz so that they keep the same magnitude beca"
