formula "_BT2_Transform2" {
    category "MB3D transforms"
    description "Mandelbulb3D formula _BT2_Transform2. This is one of the 'hollowing' out transforms I wrote to combine with the T1 Pine Tree Mandelbulb.  Use sparingly (ever few iterations, maybe the next to last iteration you want to increase the detail"
